  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup dry white wine (such as Sauvignon Blanc)",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "2 tablespoons heavy cream",
    "2 teaspoons very finely minced shallots",
    "4 ounces cold unsalted butter, cut into 1-inch cubes",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper",
    "salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HX_-9LAopdlfIlcuWzbYaboFe4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246931-chef-johns-beurre-blane-ddmfs--step-1-007-4621240f250d4d8abde41817923af836.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246931/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place wine, lemon juice, cream, and shallots in a saucepan. Bring to a simmer over medium-high heat. Reduce heat to medium and let simmer until liquid is reduced by about 75%, 4 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MILZzLeuEg7JpxEYhBV1X6_8SFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246931-chef-johns-beurre-blane-ddmfs--step-2-014-c7f0d1a2b0044440bd6cc8077e0696fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246931/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to the lowest setting and whisk in 2 cubes butter. Keep butter moving until it completely melts. Add a few more cubes, whisking continuously so butter emulsifies into wine-lemon juice mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tu8aETpBJuoMk_AnA8bR_BxaPq8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246931-chef-johns-beurre-blane-ddmfs--step-3-018-1e4cedf7fef84d1ca03bc54472d5c3f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246931/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue to add remaining butter, a few cubes at a time, until sauce has a thick, luxurious texture, 4 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QtSaD5NW4tIsgXbKLMe9T_K61AU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246931-chef-johns-beurre-blane-ddmfs--step-4-025-fc8ec379ec05445d972bdca1142a20c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246931/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the saucepan from heat. Season with cayenne pepper and salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iJj4c6sv19BhF9tqVsFEnDWCgsk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/246931-chef-johns-beurre-blanc-DDMFS-4x3-0723821c36a448f48154858e6b60393e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246931/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
